    "description": "Assignment 20.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EST301 · Assessment 1/4</span>\n<h2>Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 12781 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EST301 · Đầu điểm 1/4</span>\n<h2>Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 12781 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">25-30 minutes / group</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO4 5, 6, 7, 8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Presentation on a topic:<br>Option 1: Suggested topics: 1. Verb Phrases; 2. Adverbials; 3. Auxilliary Verb Phrases; 4. Noun phrases; 5. Sentences within sentences; 6. Wh-clauses; 7. Non-finite Clauses<br><br>Option 2: Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Lessons learned in the course; evaluating, comparing and contrasting, synthesizing content from various resources</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">- Students are divided into small groups of 4-5 members to give a group oral presentation (within 25 - 30 minutes) on a topic given by instructors.<br>- The presentation content must include sufficient content on the topic learned in the course with practical examples, common syntactic errors identified among language learners, and similarities and differences between English and Vietnamese regarding the syntactic aspects observed.<br>- The presentation has two main parts for assessing:<br>(1) group score 50%: organization, subject knowledge, slides;<br>(2) individual score 50%: language use, presentation skills<br>For more details, please refer to the Appendix.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Instructions, schedules, and topics for each assignment must be provided to students in advance.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 58 — Assignment - Group Assigment</li><li>Session 59 — Assignment - Group Assigment</li><li>Session 60 — Assignment - Group Assigment</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 58 — Assignment - Group Assigment</li><li>Buổi 59 — Assignment - Group Assigment</li><li>Buổi 60 — Assignment - Group Assigment</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
